  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to meditate upon a single veil you have shaped, allowing you to shift and reshape its akashic energies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Veilweaver level 5th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can spend 1 hour in meditation to unshape a single veil you have shaped, and then immediately shape a new veil. You can bind this newly shaped veil if you are capable of doing so as part of this process.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc48\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
